@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
state "已保存" as Saved
state "编辑中" as Editing
state "保存中" as Saving
state "保存失败" as Failed
[*] --> Saved : 创建／读取成功
Saved --> Editing : 用户输入／更新草稿批次
Editing --> Editing : 持续输入／重置静默计时
Editing --> Saving : 静默满 1 秒或退出\n／提交当前快照
Saving --> Saving : 新输入／更新待提交草稿
Saving --> Saved : 成功 [当前批次已全部确认]\n／更新 savedRevision
Saving --> Editing : 成功 [有后续编辑]\n／更新版本，安排下一批提交
Saving --> Failed : 失败／保留草稿
Failed --> Saving : 用户重试／提交当前快照
Failed --> Editing : 用户继续编辑／更新草稿
@enduml
